{"id":778,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"There was a scientist who peeked under Mimikyu’s old rag in the name of research. The scientist died of a mysterious disease."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It wears a rag fashioned into a Pikachu costume in an effort to look less scary. Unfortunately, the costume only makes it creepier."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"A gust of wind revealed what hides under this Pokémon’s rag to a passing Trainer, who went home and died painfully that very night."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Although it’s a quiet, lonely Pokémon, if you try to look at what’s under its rag, it will become agitated and resist violently."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"A lonely Pokémon, it conceals its terrifying appearance beneath an old rag so it can get closer to people and other Pokémon."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Its actual appearance is unknown. A scholar who saw what was under its rag was overwhelmed by terror and died from the shock."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Disguise","hidden":false,"description":"Once per battle, the shroud that covers the Pokémon can protect it from an attack."}],"eggGroups":["Amorphous"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Yellow","shape":"Squiggle","evolution":{"id":778,"name":"Mimikyu","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,10],[1,150],[1,310],[1,383],[1,452],[6,425],[12,104],[18,608],[24,102],[30,468],[36,163],[42,421],[48,204],[54,583],[60,220]],"machine":[339,807,204,109,174,399,605,409,577,203,263,374,202,416,506,63,141,113,581,101,220,566,583,884,182,244,94,240,156,247,421,214,180,164,241,14,36,269,851,168,87,86,85,885,271,433,261,404],"egg":[174,194],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me2pt5-238","name":"Team Rocket's Mimikyu","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"238","artist":"GOSSAN","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-238/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.c